{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the demo of <strong>Idle Frontier</strong>, a laid-back idle cultivation game that blends base-building, automation, and asynchronous PvP. Step into the role of a divine architect and begin shaping your own peaceful cultivation village!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf31 Try Core Systems First</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Immortal Village</strong>: Use cards to place buildings, gather resources, and manage production to kickstart your cultivation empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle Growth</strong>: Collect resources and auto-battle even when offline. Progress effortlessly, with no stress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tech Tree</strong>: Unlock early technologies and boost your productivity across systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/extras/Demo3\u5408\u4e00.gif?t=1748658508\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f PvP via Steam Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upload your character build and challenge others asynchronously in a \u201csword duel\u201d leaderboard system\u2014test your strength anytime, no need to be online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/extras/6pvp.gif?t=1748658508\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddd8 Minimized Idle Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo supports true minimized auto-run\u2014cultivate while working, gaming, or just chilling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/extras/2\u6700\u5c0f\u5316.gif?t=1748658508\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f This demo is available in <strong>Simplified Chinese only</strong>. More content, including full sects, gear crafting, alchemy, and open-world adventures, will be included in the full release.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your immortal journey starts here. Build freely, idle peacefully\u2014welcome to the first stage of <i>Idle Frontier</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695460?t=1748658508","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/287d27284507a1ab6fbb9247ddc3e3a8def96529/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748658508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/80d634fb4d35e9f0d7207aa819780072f51db342/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748658508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/80d634fb4d35e9f0d7207aa819780072f51db342/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748658508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the demo of <strong>Idle Frontier</strong>, a laid-back idle cultivation game that blends base-building, automation, and asynchronous PvP. Step into the role of a divine architect and begin shaping your own peaceful cultivation village!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf31 Try Core Systems First</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Immortal Village</strong>: Use cards to place buildings, gather resources, and manage production to kickstart your cultivation empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle Growth</strong>: Collect resources and auto-battle even when offline. Progress effortlessly, with no stress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tech Tree</strong>: Unlock early technologies and boost your productivity across systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/extras/Demo3\u5408\u4e00.gif?t=1748658508\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f PvP via Steam Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upload your character build and challenge others asynchronously in a \u201csword duel\u201d leaderboard system\u2014test your strength anytime, no need to be online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/extras/6pvp.gif?t=1748658508\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddd8 Minimized Idle Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo supports true minimized auto-run\u2014cultivate while working, gaming, or just chilling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695460/extras/2\u6700\u5c0f\u5316.gif?t=1748658508\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f This demo is available in <strong>Simplified Chinese only</strong>. More content, including full sects, gear crafting, alchemy, and open-world adventures, will be included in the full release.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your immortal journey starts here. Build freely, idle peacefully\u2014welcome to the first stage of <i>Idle Frontier</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["\u4e0d\u6015\u864e\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3224850","name":"\u6478\u9c7c\u4ed9\u6751"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com